{"sha": "f68600fa2a9ffa39c9cdbac23ad8a4ba7193809a2373641ee279762f9d8d6e13", "body": ["\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:1}", "在 $+\\infty$ 处展开，除首项外再取两项：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{x^2 + x + 1} ,", "\\qquad", "\\ln(x^2 + x) - 2\\ln x,", "\\qquad", "\\frac{x + \\sin x}{x - \\ln x} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:2}", "讨论以下和式的敛散性（收敛或发散），并在发散时给出", "$\\sum_{k \\leq n} k^\\alpha$ 的首项渐近，分 $\\alpha >", "-1$、$\\alpha = -1$、$\\alpha < -1$ 三种情形讨论，借助", "\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:3}", "证明 $H_n = \\ln n + \\gamma + \\frac{1}{2n} + o\\bigl(\\frac1n\\bigr)$。", "\\emph{（研究 $v_n = H_n - \\ln n - \\gamma$：证明 $v_n - v_{n+1} =", "\\frac{1}{2n^2} + O(n^{-3})$，并对尾项求和，与", "$\\sum_{k \\geq n} \\frac{1}{2k^2} \\sim \\frac{1}{2n}$ 作比较 ---", "由\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}~(1)可知。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:4}", "利用斯特林公式，求下列各式的等价量：$\\dfrac{(3n)!}{(n!)^3}$；", "$\\;\\dfrac{n!}{n^n}$；$\\;\\sqrt[n]{n!}$（写成 $\\frac n\\eu(1 + o(1))$ 的形式，", "并精确到两项）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:5}", "设 $n \\geq 2$，证明 $x^n + x = 1$ 恰有一个解 $x_n", "\\in \\intoo{0}{1}$，且 $x_n \\to 1$，并证明", "\\[", "x_n = 1 - \\frac{\\ln n}{n} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\emph{（由 $x_n^n = 1 - x_n$ 取对数，并利用", "$x_n = 1 - \\varepsilon_n$ 逐步迭代。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:6}", "将\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:tan}再推进一阶：", "\\[", "x_n = n\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 - \\frac{1}{n\\pi} + \\frac{1}{2n^2\\pi} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\emph{（精确写出 $\\cot y_n = x_n$，展开 $\\cot y = \\frac1y -", "\\frac y3 + o(y)$，以及 $x_n = n\\pi(1 + \\frac{1}{2n} - \\dots)$，并", "对照确定各项。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:7}", "求 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\dfrac{1}{n!}\\sum_{k=0}^{n} k!$", "\\emph{（对去掉最后两项后的和式作放缩）}，并推出渐近展开式", "$\\sum_{k \\leq n} k! = n!\\bigl(1 + \\frac1n +", "O(n^{-2})\\bigr)$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:8}", "设 $u_0 > 0$ 且 $u_{n+1} = u_n + \\dfrac{1}{u_n}$。证明 $u_n", "\\to \\infty$，再证 $u_n \\sim \\sqrt{2n}$ \\emph{（研究 $u_n^2$：", "其增量为 $2 + u_n^{-2}$；求和）}，并进一步精确化：", "\\[", "u_n = \\sqrt{2n}\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\ln n}{8n} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\emph{（由 $u_n^2 = 2n + \\sum_{k<n} u_k^{-2} + u_0^2$ 及 $u_k^2", "\\sim 2k$，和式 $\\sim \\frac12\\ln n$ 由", "\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}可得。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:9}", "（一个略作变形的黎曼和）求下列量的渐近性态：", "\\[", "S_n = \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{n + k\\ln n} .", "\\]", "\\emph{（提出 $n$：$S_n = \\frac1n\\sum_k \\bigl(1 +", "\\frac{k\\ln n}{n}\\bigr)^{-1}$；识别出一个带", "缓变参数 $t = \\ln n$ 的黎曼型和，计算 $\\int_0^1", "\\frac{\\dd u}{1 + tu} = \\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}$，并得出 $S_n \\sim", "\\frac{\\ln\\ln n}{\\ln n}$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:10}", "证明恒等式 $(\\ln n)^{\\ln n} = n^{\\ln\\ln n}$，再将", "以下各式在无穷远处按 $o(\\cdot)$ 由小到大排序，并给出", "证明：$n^2$、$(\\ln n)^{\\ln n}$、$2^n$、$n!$、$n^n$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:11}", "（$\\sum 1/k^2$ 的尾项，取两项）利用精确的裂项相消", "$\\sum_{k > n} \\frac{1}{k(k+1)} = \\frac{1}{n+1}$ 及", "分解式 $\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac{1}{k(k+1)} +", "\\frac{1}{k^2(k+1)}$，证明", "\\[", "\\sum_{k > n} \\frac{1}{k^2}", "= \\frac1n - \\frac{1}{2n^2} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:comparison:12}", "设 $u_0 = \\frac12$ 且 $u_{n+1} = u_n + \\eu^{-u_n}$。证明", "$u_n \\to \\infty$，再 --- 令 $v_n = \\eu^{u_n}$，并证明", "$v_{n+1} = v_n + 1 + \\frac{1}{2v_n} + O\\bigl(v_n^{-2}\\bigr)$ ---", "由此建立如下：", "\\[", "u_n = \\ln n + \\frac{\\ln n}{2n} + O\\Bigl(\\frac1n\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}